.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120486","id":5023758495,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABK3B4nw","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-20T15:04:55Z","updated_at":"2026-07-20T15:08:56Z","body":"> Dictionaries don't allow editing of keys, the editing interface is read-only.\n\nWhy is it a regression then? Were they somehow editable in 4.6?\nEDIT:\nSeems like they were, based on another report.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5023758495/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5027593822","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120486#issuecomment-5027593822","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120486","id":5027593822,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABK6r-Xg","user":{"login":"ajreckof","id":66184050,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTg0MDUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66184050?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof","html_url":"https://github.com/ajreckof","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-20T21:45:44Z","updated_at":"2026-07-20T21:46:16Z","body":"Oh from the other reports I have a better understanding of this. I thought it was the right click which was missing. But it seems that even when read-only you can still modify a resource value as it doesn't change the property as undo redo is handled directly by the object contrary to array and dictionarries that are set with a new dict/array each time.\nFrom this new information I know that it is a regression from #118614 and the same as what i had raised as comment https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118614#issuecomment-4367945884. I have already thought on how to fix that while keeping improvement of the linked PR. I am currenctly working on it and will publish a PR soon.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5027593822/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]